    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Embark on a Cosmic Journey to Find Hidden Hearts \u2665!</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a <strong>storybook-like world</strong> filled with beautifully hand-drawn 2D illustrations and embark on a <strong>simple yet charming hidden object adventure</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes place in the <strong>vastness of space</strong>! \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0c<br>Explore a universe full of <strong>unique and whimsical planets</strong>, each with its own enchanting scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Features \ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Find the Hidden Hearts \u2665</strong> \u2014 Discover cleverly hidden hearts within beautifully illustrated landscapes! <br>\ud83e\ude90 <strong>A Universe of Unique Planets</strong> \u2014 Travel through different planets, each with its own theme and atmosphere!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-Drawn Art</strong> \u2014 Every illustration is <strong>lovingly crafted with ballpoint pen</strong>, giving it a warm and nostalgic feel!<br>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Simple Controls</strong> \u2014 Just <strong>click with your mouse</strong> to play, making it easy and relaxing for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a peaceful cosmic adventure and immerse yourself in a world of hidden wonders!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udc95</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>Embark on a Cosmic Journey to Find Hidden Hearts \u2665!</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a <strong>storybook-like world</strong> filled with beautifully hand-drawn 2D illustrations and embark on a <strong>simple yet charming hidden object adventure</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey takes place in the <strong>vastness of space</strong>! \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0c<br>Explore a universe full of <strong>unique and whimsical planets</strong>, each with its own enchanting scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Features \ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Find the Hidden Hearts \u2665</strong> \u2014 Discover cleverly hidden hearts within beautifully illustrated landscapes! <br>\ud83e\ude90 <strong>A Universe of Unique Planets</strong> \u2014 Travel through different planets, each with its own theme and atmosphere!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-Drawn Art</strong> \u2014 Every illustration is <strong>lovingly crafted with ballpoint pen</strong>, giving it a warm and nostalgic feel!<br>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f <strong>Simple Controls</strong> \u2014 Just <strong>click with your mouse</strong> to play, making it easy and relaxing for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a peaceful cosmic adventure and immerse yourself in a world of hidden wonders!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udc95</p>",
